  "appliesTo": "We are responsible for setting dates for community and voluntary controlled schools. In the interests of consistency for families across the borough, we would recommend the adoption of these dates by voluntary aided, foundation, academy and free schools.",
  "academyNote": "These term dates are for guidance only. Some schools set their own term dates or agree minor local variations; foundation and voluntary aided schools are set by the governing body and free schools and academies by the academy trust.",
  "localFacts": [
    {
      "fact": "The standardised school year principles were amended and approved by the Cheshire West and Chester Cabinet on 5 July 2023.",
      "source": "https://www.cheshirewestandchester.gov.uk/residents/education-and-learning/school-term-and-holiday-dates"
    },
    {
      "fact": "October half term is the week that falls on the last Monday in October.",
      "source": "https://www.cheshirewestandchester.gov.uk/residents/education-and-learning/school-term-and-holiday-dates"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Schools with more than fifty percent of pupils from a neighbouring local authority may align their term and holiday dates with that authority.",
      "source": "https://www.cheshirewestandchester.gov.uk/residents/education-and-learning/school-term-and-holiday-dates"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Voluntary controlled primary schools may align their dates with the aided secondary school for which they are a named feeder school.",
      "source": "https://www.cheshirewestandchester.gov.uk/residents/education-and-learning/school-term-and-holiday-dates"
    },
    {
      "fact": "The council's community and voluntary controlled schools do not get a two week break at summer half term, unlike some neighbouring authorities such as Cheshire East.",
      "source": "https://www.cheshirewestandchester.gov.uk/residents/education-and-learning/school-term-and-holiday-dates"
    },
    {
      "fact": "The council was part of the Learn Together Partnership of Cheshire and Merseyside authorities, now disbanded, so its dates can differ from Flintshire, Shropshire and Staffordshire.",
      "source": "https://www.cheshirewestandchester.gov.uk/residents/education-and-learning/school-term-and-holiday-dates"
    }
  ],
